=begin test :id<fence-language-becomes-lang> :caption('the language on an opening fence becomes the :lang of a code block')
=begin fixture
=begin markdown
```python
print(1)
```
=end markdown
=end fixture
=for assert
code[ :lang<python> ]
=end test

=begin test :id<tilde-fence-is-a-fence> :caption('a tilde fence is read as a backtick fence is')
=begin fixture
=begin markdown
~~~rust
fn main() {}
~~~
=end markdown
=end fixture
=for assert
code[ :lang<rust> ]
=end test
